    `people dwell in it or occupy it, by right or otherwise, by day or night`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `it was intended for dwelling or occupation`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `wholly or partly below the surface of the ground`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `a building`                                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `another structure`                                                IS A BOOLEAN

